name:           Box3D
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis:       Low-level bindings to the Box3D physics engine
description:    Low-level FFI bindings to Box3D, Erin Catto's 3D rigid-body physics engine.
                The engine's C sources (MIT licensed) are bundled and compiled with the
                package, so no system library is needed.
                .
                Each module follows one part of the C API, and each wrapper's documentation
                names the function it binds. See the README for an example, the exact engine
                revision and the rules on callbacks and object lifetimes.
category:       Physics
author:         IC Rainbow
maintainer:     aenor.realm@gmail.com
copyright:      2026 IC Rainbow
license:        BSD-3-Clause AND MIT
license-files:  LICENSE,
                upstream/LICENSE
build-type:     Simple
tested-with:
    GHC == 9.10.3
